<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Nahime Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nahime Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nahi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahime</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nahime Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Nahime maxaafa, heedzu bessan shaakidi be7anaw danda7etees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Yihuda biitta aysana mela, Farse kawoy kiitida Nahimey, kaalethin, Yerusalaame dirsa gimbey ooraxidaysa odiya taarike.</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Iziri, higge maxaafa nabbabidaysanne asay banta nagara paaxidysa odiya maxaafa.</para>
  <para style="ipi">3. Nahimey Yihuda biitta aysishe oothida hara oosota odees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafan daro qoncidi bentey Nahimey Xoossan ammanetidaysanne I woossida woosata.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iziranne Nahime maxaafan de7iya waanna qofati,</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Yihuda maaddanaw Xoossay allaga kawota go7etis</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Yihuda asay allaga biitta asan sugetidosona</para>
  <para style="ipi">3. Yihudi geeyidi Xoossako simmanaw bessees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Izira maxaafay xoossa keethaanne yarsho bessa bolla dummayidi odees; Nahime maxaafay Yerusalaame katama gimbe dirsa keexo bolla caddidi odees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalaame katama gimbe dirsa oosetetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="NEH 1:1-7:73">1:1—7:73</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Nahimey Yerusalaames woossida woosa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="NEH 1:1-2:8">1:1—2:8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Nahimey ayso oosos Yerusalaame buussaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="NEH 2:9-20">2:9-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Gimbe dirsa oosuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="NEH 3:1-7:4">3:1—7:4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Nahimey di7ope simmida asaa mazgabis <char style="ior">(<ref loc="NEH 7:5-53">7:5-53</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Izira gaason asaa ayyaana de7oy laametis <char style="ior">(<ref loc="NEH 8:1-10:39">8:1—10:39</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nahime gaason biitta bolla yida laamiya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="NEH 11:1-12:47">11:1—12:47</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nahime woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Hakaliya na7aa Nahime qaalay haysa. Arxekisisi Farse biittan kawotin laatamantho laythan, Kisile geetetiya ageenan, taani Nahimey waanna katama gidiya Suusan de7ayis. <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Ta ishatape issoy, Hanaani, hara asatara issife Yihudape taako yin, taani Yerusalaamebanne Babiloone di7etonna attida Ayhudetaba enta oychas.<verse eid="NEH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Enti zaaridi, “Babiloone di7etonna attida asaynne di7etidi simmida Ayhudeti gita metoninne kawushan de7oosona. Yerusalaame gimbe dirsay laaletis qassi gimbiya pengeti taman xuugetidosona” yaagidosona.<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Ta haysa ubbaa si7ida wode uttada yeekas. Daro gallas azzanoninne xooman salo Xoossaa haysada yaagada woossas.<verse eid="NEH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />“Abeeti Godaw, salo Xoossaw, gitaw, bonchetidayso, nena doseysatasinne ne kiita naageysatas ne merina siiqo caaquwa naagasa. <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />Taani ne aylley, ne aylle gidida Isra7eele asaa gisho qammanne gallas woossiya woosa si7anaw ne haythay hayzo; ne ayfey tana xeello. Nu Isra7eele asay oothida nagaraa ubbaa new paaxayis; tuma taaninne ta mayzati nena naaqida. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Nuuni ne bolla daro iita nagara oothida; neeni ne aylliya Muse baggara nuus immida kiitaa, wogaanne higgiya naagibooko. <verse eid="NEH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />Ne aylliya Muses ne odida qaala hayyana qopa; neeni, ‘Hinte taw ammanetona ixiko, taani hintena Ayhude gidonna biittatan laallana. <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />Shin hinte taako simmidi, ta kiita naagiko, hinte hari attoshin sa7aa gaxaa gakanaw laaletikoka, ta sunthay xeegetana mela doorida bessaa zaarada ehana’ gidaysa qopa.<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />“Neeni ne gita wolqaaninne ne mino qesiyan woza ekida ne aylletanne ne asata. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Abeeti Godaw, taani ne aylley woossiya woosaanne nena bonchanaw dosiya, ne aylleta woosa ne haythay si7o. Ta ne aylley hachi oothanaw koyidabay taw ushacanaada, kawa sinthan taw saba imma” yaagas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Taani he wode kawas woyne ushsha tigiya asi.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nahimey Yerusalaame Buussaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Arxekisisi kawotida laatamantho laythan, Nisaane geetetiya ageenan, issi gallas kawa sinthan woyne ushsha shiishas. He gallasepe attishin, kase kawa sinthan azzana erike. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Hessa gisho, kawoy, “Nena sakiyabay baawa, shin haysa mela ayis azzanadii? Hessi ne wozanay issiban azzanidaysa bessees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Yaagin, taani daro yayyada, kawako, <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />“Kawoy merinaw kawoto! Ta mayzati moogetida katamay laaletidi dhayin, qassi he katamaa dirsa pengeti taman xuugetin ayis azzanikina?” yaagas.<verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Kawoy zaaridi, “Yaatin, ha77i ta new ay oothana mela koyay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Taani salo Xoossaa woossa simmada, <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />kawako, “Kawaw, ta ne sinthan saba demmidaba gidikonne ta oyshay ufaysiyabaa gidiko, Yihuda biitta, ta mayzati moogetida katamaa bada zaara keexana mela tana yeddarki” yaagas.<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />He wode kawiya, Kawa Arxekisisa matan uttida de7ishin, kawoy zaaridi, “Ne ogey ay mela wode ekanee? Ne awude simmanee?” yaagidi tana oychis. Taani ta simmana wodiya iyaw odin, kawoy ufaytidi tana yeddis.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Qassi, “Kawa, nena ufaysiyabaa gidiko, ta Yihuda gakanaw he biittara kanthada aadhana mela Efraxiisa shaafape wuloha baggara de7iya biitta haareysatas dabdaabey xaafeto” yaagada kawa woossas. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Hessadaka, “Xoossa keetha pengiya giigisanaw, katamaa gimbe dirsaa diranawunne ta daana keethaa keexanaw taw mithi immana mela kawo wora naagiya Asaafas dabdaabey xaafeto” yaagada oychas. Xoossaa lo77o kushey taara de7iya gisho kawoy taani oychidaba ubba immis.<verse eid="NEH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Kawoy taara guutha toora moconatanne para toggeyisata yeddis. Taani entara issife Efraxiisa shaafape wuloha bagga biitta gakada kawoy yeddida dabdaabiya he biitta haareysatas immas. <verse eid="NEH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Shin Horoona katama asi gidida Sanbalaaxinne Amoone biitta halaqa gidida Xoobbey, “Isra7eele asaas lo77oba oothiya asi yis” geetetidaysa si7ida wode daro yilotidosona.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nahimey Yerusalaame Gimbe dirsa Be7is</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Taani Yerusalaame gakada heedzu gallas yan gam7as. <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />Yerusalaames taani oothana mela Xoossay ta wozanan wothida qofaa oodeska odabike. Hessafe guye, taara de7iya asaape guuthata ekada qamma dendada bas. He wode taani toggida mehiyape hara toga mehey nuus baawa. <verse eid="NEH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Taani bilahe dendada Zangaara Pengiyara kanthada, Dawe Pulto geetetiya bessaara aadhada, Pito Penge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pito Penge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yerusalaame katamaa buuren keetha pito ubba yeggiya bessi guussu.</char></note> geetetiya bessaa gakanaw bas. Yaara aadhashe laaletida Yerusalaame gimbiyanne taman xuugetida gimbe pengeta be7as. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Hessafe simmada Pulto Pengiyakonne kawa teqe haathay de7iya bessaa bas. Gidoshin, ta toggida mehey aadhiya oge demmabike. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Hessa gisho, qamma Qediroona Zangaara giddora aadhada gimbiya be7as. Wursethan, guye simmada Zangaara Pengiyara katamaa gelas.<verse eid="NEH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Yan de7iya halaqatape oonika taani awu bidaako, woyko ay oothidaako eribeenna. Ayis giiko, taani Ayhudetas, kahinetas, bonchetida asatas, halaqatasinne oosuwa oothanaw de7iya asaape oodeska ta qofaa odabike. <verse eid="NEH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Hessefe guye, entako, “Nuuni ay mela meton de7iyako be7eeta; Yerusalaame katamay laaletis; gimbe pengeti taman xuugetidosona. Ha yiite, Yerusalaame gimbiya zaaridi gimboos; nuna gakida yeella ane diggoos” yaagas. <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Qassi Xoossaa lo77o kushey taara de7eysanne kawoy taw odidaba ubbaa entaw odas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Enti zaaridi, “Ane dendoos; zaaridi gimboos” yaagidi banta kushiya lo77o oosos minthidosona.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Shin Horoona katamaa asi gidida Sanbalaaxi, Amoone biitta asi gidida Xoobeynne Araba biitta asi gidida Geesamey hessa si7ida wode, nu bolla qelqisidi miicidosona. “Haysi hinte oothiyabay ayibee? Woyko kawa bolla makallanaw koyeetii?” yaagidi oychidosona.<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Taani zaarada, “Salo Xoossay nuna polisana; nuuni iya aylleti dendidi oothana. Shin Yerusalaamen hintew gishoy woyko hintena gathiyabay woyko hintena qofisiyabay baawa” yaagas.<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Gimbe Dirsa Oosanchota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Kahine halaqay Eliyaseebinne hara kahineti Dorsa Pengiya zaari gimbidi Xoossas dummayidosona; sanqa aathidosona. Enti Xeeta geetetiya gimbe shakuwafe bidi Hanaani7eela geetetiya gimbe shakuwa gakanaw gimbidi Xoossas dummayidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Enta lanqen de7iya bessaa Iyaarko asay gimbin, kaallidi de7eysa Imira na7ay Zakuri gimbis.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Hasinaa7a nayti Molo Pengiya gimbidosona. Enti gobane essidi, sanqa aathidosona; sanqa gordiya kasuwanne kasuwa gelsiya sagaayuwa giigisidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Enta kaallidi de7iya bessaa Haqooxa na7a gidida Uraya na7ay Maremooti gimbis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:4">Iyape kaallidi de7iya bessaa Masezabeela na7a Baraka na7ay Masulaami gimbis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:4">Iyape kaallidi de7iya bessaa Ba7ana na7ay Saadoqi gimbis.<verse eid="NEH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Iya matan de7iya bessaa Taqoha katamaa asati gimbidosona. Shin he katamaa halaqati bantaw imetida oosuwa oothonna ixidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Paseha na7ay Yodaaheynne Baasodiya na7ay Masulaami Gal7a Pengiya gimbidosona. Enti gobane essidi, sanqa aathidosona; sanqa gordiya kasuwanne kasuwa gelsiya sagaayuwa giigisidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Enta lanqen de7iya bessaa Gaba7oona katamaa asi gidida Malaaxinne Meronoota katamaa asi gidida Yadooni gimbidosona. Gaba7oonanne Mixipha katamaa asay entara issife gididi, Efraxiisa shaafape wuloha bagga biitta haareysi de7iya keethaa gakanaw de7iya bessaa gimbidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Worqa sheeshiya Harihaya na7ay Uzi7eeli enta matan de7iya bessaa gimbis. Qassi iya matan de7iya bessaa shitto oothiya Hanaani gimbis. Enti nam7ay issife Yerusalaame Dalga Gimbiya geetetiya bessaa gakanaw de7iya bessaa gimbidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Enta matan de7iya bessaa Huura na7ay, Yerusalaame woradaas baggaa haariya Rafayi gimbis.<verse eid="NEH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Haruma na7ay Yadayi ba keethaafe sintha baggara de7iya bessaa gimbis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:10">Iya matan de7iya bessaa Asebaana na7ay Hatushi gimbis.<verse eid="NEH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Harima na7ay Malkeynne Pahati-Moo7aba na7ay Hashubi iya matan de7iya bessaanne Itoone Shako gimbiya gimbidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Enta matan de7iya bessaa Haloheesa na7ay, Yerusalaame woradaas nam7antho baggaa haariya Saluminne iya macca nayti gimbidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Hanuninne Zanoha kataman de7iya asay issife Zangaara Pengiya gimbidosona. Enti gobane essidi, sanqa aathidosona; sanqa gordiya mithaanne mithaa gelsiya sagaayuwa giigisidosona. Pito Pengiya gakanaw issi mukulu wadha adussa gimbiya gujidi gimbidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Rakaaba na7ay, Beet-Hakareema woradaa haariya Malkey Pito Pengiya gimbis. Enti gobane essidi, sanqa aathidosona; sanqa gordiya kasuwanne kasuwa gelsiya sagaayuwa giigisidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Kolihaaza na7ay, Mixipha woradaa haariya Salumi Pulto Pengiya zaaridi gimbis. I pengiyas kama giigisidi sanqa aathis; sanqa gordiya kasuwanne kasuwa gelsiya sagaayuwa giigisis. Qassi, Selaha teqe haathay de7iya baggara kawa atakilte bessaafe doomidi, Dawita Katamaape dugethe wodhisiya dethaa gakanaw de7iya gimbiya gimbis. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Beet-Xura woradaas baggaa haariya Azibuuqe na7ay Nahimey gimbis. I Dawita duufuwape sintha baggara de7iya bessaa gakanaw, asi oothida teqe haathay de7iya bessaa gakanaw, olanchota keethaa gakanaw de7iya bessaa gimbis.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Haysafe kaalleysa Baana na7aa Rehuuma aawatetha garsan de7iya Leeweti gimbidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:17">Enta matan de7iya bessaa Qi7aala woradaas baggaa haariya Hashabi ba woradaa sunthan gimbis. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Iyape kaallidi Henadaada na7ay, Qi7aala woradaas nam7antho bagga haariya Bawi gimbidosona. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Enta matan de7iya bessaa Iyyasu na7ay, Mixipha woradaa haariya Ezeri gimbis. I ola miishe wothiya keethaafe sintha baggara gimbiya maazaniya gakanaw de7iya bessa gimbis. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Iyape kaalleysa Zabaya na7ay Baaroki, gimbiya maazaniyape bidi, kahine halaqaa Eliyaseeba keethaa pengiya gakanaw de7iya bessaa gimbis. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Iyape kaalleysa Haqooxa na7aa gidida Uraya na7ay Maremooti Eliyaseeba keetha pengiyafe doomidi, wursethi gakanaw de7iya bessaa gimbis.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Iyape kaallidi de7eysa heeran de7iya kahineti gimbidosona. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Entafe kaallidi Biniyaameynne Hashubi banta keethaa sinthan de7iya bessaa gimbidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:23">Entafe kaallidi Ananiya na7a gidida Ma7iseya na7ay Azaari ba keethaa sinthan de7iya bessaa gimbis. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Iyape kaallidi Azaara keethaafe bidi, gimbiya maazaniya gakanaw de7iya bessaa Henadaada na7ay Benuyi gimbis. <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />Uzaya na7ay Palali gimbiya maazaniyape doomidi, I naageysata dabaaba matan de7iya qommo bagga kawo gadho naago gimbiya gakanaw de7iya bessaa gimbis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:25">Iyape kaallidi de7eysa Paanose na7ay Padaynne <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />Ofeela deriya bolla de7iya Xoossa keethaa aylleti gimbidosona. Enti Haatha Pengiya matan doloha baggan de7iya bessaanne naago gimbiya gakanaw de7iya bessaa gimbidosona. <verse eid="NEH 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Entafe kaallidi Taqoha katamaa asay gimbiya sinthan de7iya bessaafe bidi, Ofeela matan de7iya gimbiya gakanaw de7iya bessaa gimbidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Para Pengiyafe qommo baggan, banta keethaa sinthan de7iya bessaa kahineti gimbidosona. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Entafe kaallidi Imera na7ay Saadoqi ba keethaa sinthan de7iya bessaa gimbis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:29">Iyape kaallidi Doloha Pengiya naagiya Sakana na7ay Shamayey gimbis. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Iyape kaallidi Salama na7ay Hananinne Zalafa usupuntho na7a gidida Hanunra gimbidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:30">Entafe kaallidi Baraka na7ay Masulaami ba kifiliyape sinthan de7iya bessaa gimbis. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Iyape kaallidi Xomooso Pengiya sinthan de7iya Xoossa keetha oosanchotanne zal7anchota keethaa gakanaw de7iya bessaa worqa sheeshiya Malkey gimbis. Qassi I gimbe maazaniyas bolla baggara de7iya bessaaka gimbis. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Maazaniyas qommo bagga kifiliyapenne Dorsa Pengiyafe giddon de7iya bessaa worqa sheesheysatinne zal7anchoti gimbidosona.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Morkey Medhida Eqetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Nuuni dirsa gimbe oosuwa doomidaysa Sanbalaaxi si7ida wode yilo eexidi nuna leqis. <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />Ba laggetanne Samaare olanchota sinthan, “Ha pathonna Ayhudeti ay oothanaw qopoona? Dirsa gimbiya zaari gimbanaw koyoonayee? Yarsho yarshanaw koyoonayee? Enti issi gallasan oosuwa oothidi wursana daanii? Enti gimbees haniya shuchata xuugetidi dooretidaysa giddofe kessanaw danda7oona?” yaagis.<verse eid="NEH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Iya matan eqida Amoone biitta asi gidida Xoobbey, “Enti waanida gimbe gimbanaw danda7oona? Enti gimbiya bolla workani keyako laaletana” yaagidi leqis.<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Taani haysada yaagada woossas; “Nu Xoossaw, enti nuna waati leqisiyako, haysa be7a! Enti nuna cayiya cashshay entaw gido. Banta aquwa bonqetidi allaga biittan di7etida asi gido. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Enti gimbeyisata cashshan kawushida gisho, enta naaqoy geemmofo; enta nagaraa ne sinthafe quchofa” yaagas.<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Nuuni gimbiya oosuwa qanxonna oothida. Asay oosuwa minni oothida gisho gimbiya oosoy ellesidi bagga gakis.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Sanbalaaxi, Xoobbey, Arabe asay, Amoone asaynne Ashdooda asay Yerusalaame gimbe oosoy lo77o oosetishe de7eysanne dooya bessati gordetidaysa si7ida wode daro yilotidosona. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Hessa gisho enti issife Yerusalaame yidi nuna olanawunne meto medhanaw maqetidosona. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Shin nuuni nu Xoossaa woossida; enta teqanaw qammanne gallas naageysata wothida.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />He wode Yihuda asay, “Toohoy nuna daabursis; buroo dendanaw koshshiya dooretida daro shuchi de7ees; yaaniya gisho, nuuni gimbiya gimbanaw danda7oko” yaagidosona.<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Nu morketi, “Enti nu oothiyaba eranaapenne be7anaape sinthe nu enta giddo gelidi enta wodhana; enta oosuwaka essana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="NEH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Nu morketa heeran de7iya Ayhudeti tamma simmidi nu morketi nuna ubba baggara olanaw giigetoysa nuus odidosona.<verse eid="NEH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Hessa gisho, nu asaape mashshe, tooranne donge oykida asaa enta soo asan asan giigisada oosoy wuriboona heeran gimbiyas guyera garsa baggan naagana mela oothas. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Asay daggamidaysa taani be7ida wode denda eqada, asaako, enta kaaletheysatakonne halaqatako, “Nu morketa yayyofite! Gitaanne yashshiya Xoossaa qopite. Hinte ishatas, hinte adde naytasinne macca naytas, hinte machetasinne hinte keethaas oletite” yaagas.<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Nu morketi nuna qohanaw maqetidaysa nuuni eridaysa enti si7idosona. Qassi Xoossay enta maquwa hada kessidaysa akeekidosona. Hessafe guye, nu ubbay simmidi, gimbe oosuwa doomida. <verse eid="NEH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />He wodepe doomidi ta asaape baggay oosuwa oothiya wode, baggay xurure ma7idi, toora, gondallenne donge oykidi naagana mela oothas. Qassi halaqati Yihuda asa ubbaafe guyera eqidi minthethoosona; <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />gimbiya gimbeysatinne koshshiyaba tookeysati issi kushen ola miishe oykidi, issi kushen ooso oothosona. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Gimbiya oothiya issoy issoy mashshe ba xeessan dancidi de7ees. Moyze punneysi ubba wode taape shaaketidi erenna.<verse eid="NEH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Kaaletheysatako, halaqatakonne asa ubbaako, “Gimbiya oosoy gitanne dalga gidiya gisho nuuni issoy issuwafe haakidi de7oos. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Hessa gisho, hinte moyze puno si7iya wode he bessaa taako haa shiiqite. Nu Xoossay nu gisho oletana” yaagas. <verse eid="NEH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Hessa gisho, wonta gontey zo7o wadhiya wodepe doomidi omarsi xoolintoy keyana gakanaw baggay oothiya wode baggay toora oykidi naagees.<verse eid="NEH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />He wode taani asaako, “Qamma nuna naaganawunne gallas oosuwa oothanaw hinte ubbay hintena maaddeysatara Yerusalaamen aqite” yaagas. <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Tana gidin, ta ishata gidin, ta asaa gidin, woyko tana naageysata gidin, nu ubbay nu ma7uwa kessonna aqoos; nu ola miishey nuupe shaaketenna.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nahimey Manqota Maaddis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Issi wode addetinne enta macheti banta koche gidida Ayhudeta bolla waassidosona. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Entafe issoti issoti, “Nuus, daro adde naytinne macca nayti de7iya gisho nu shempuwa ashshanaw nuus kathi koshshees” yaagidosona.<verse eid="NEH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Harati qassi, “Nuna gakida iita koshaape dendoysan kathi demmana gidi, nu goshsha gadiya, nu woyne gadiyanne nu keethaa oythida” yaagidosona.<verse eid="NEH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Qassi attidaysati, “Kawo giira giiranaw miishe dhayidi nu goshsha gadiyanne nu woyne bessaa oythidi miishe tal7ida. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Ayhude kochatara nuuni issi ashonne issi suuthi; nu nayti enta nayta mela. Shin nuuni nu yelida nayta aylletethas aathidi immanaw un7etida; nu macca naytape issoti issoti aylletethas bayzetidosona. Nu goshshanne nu woyne gadiya nuupe eketida gisho nu wolqa dhayida” yaagidosona.<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Taani enta waasuwanne oysha si7ida wode daro yilotas. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Ta wozanan oothanaba qopidaape guye, kaaletheysatanne halaqata xeegada, “Hinte, hinte ishatas yelora tal7ishe un7etheeta” yaagada enta kaccas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:7">He metuwaba entara odetanaw deriya shiishada, <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />“Ayhude gidonaysatas bayzetida Ayhude koche gidida nu ishata wozanaw nuus danda7etidaba ubbaa oothida. Shin hinte isha gidida Ayhudeti banta koche gidida hintew, bantana bayzana mela ootheeta; nu enta zaari wozanaw koshshees” yaagas. Kaaletheysati zaaranaba dhayidi si77i gidoosona.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Taani kaallada, “Hinte oothiyabay woga gidenna; Ayhude gidonna nu morketi nuna qelqisonna mela hinte nu Xoossaas yayyanawunne suureba oothanaw bessennee? <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Taani, ta ishatinne ta oosanchoti asaas miishenne kathi tal7ida; gidoshin, entafe yelo ekeysi atto. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Enta goshsha, woynenne shamaho zayte gadiyanne keethaa ubbaa entaw zaarite. Qassi miishepe, kathafe, woynepenne zaytepe hinte entafe ekida xeetape issi kushe yelo ekidaysa elle zaarite” yaagas.<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Enti zaaridi, “Nuuni ekidaba ubbaa entaw guye zaarana; enti nuupe tal7idaysa zaaro gidi achoko; ne nuna kiitidaysada oothana” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:12">Taani kahineta taako xeegada kaaletheysati banta gida qaala polana mela caaqisanaada oothas. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Taani ta ma7uwa qaarada qoqofashe, “Hintefe oonika ba gida qaala polonna ixiko, Xoossay iya, iya keethaafenne iya aquwape haysada qoqofidi mela kushe asho” yaagas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Shiiqida asa ubbay issi qaalan, “Amin7i” yaagidi Godaa galatidosona. Asa ubbay caaqidaysada oothidosona.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Arxekisisi kawotida laatamantho laythafe doomidi hastamanne nam7antho laythi gakanaw taani Yihuda biitta haaras. He tammanne nam7u laytha giddon tana gidin woyko ta ishati shuumas bessiya katha damooze ekibooko. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Shin taape kase shuumetidaysati asaas deexo tooho gididi, gallas gallas kathasinne woyne ushshas oytamu bira qanxisidosona. Hari attoshin shuumata aylleti asaa bolla godaa gididi un7ethidi gam7idosona. Shin taani Xoossas yayyida gisho, hessada oothabike. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Taw de7iya wolqa ubbaa Yerusalaame gimbe oosuwas immas; ta oosanchotika taara issife he oosuwa bolla gam7idosona; nu aybi biittaka shammibooko. <verse eid="NEH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Nu heeran de7iya kawotethatape yida asay attishin, gallas gallas taara miya Ayhudetinne kaaletheysati xeetanne ishatama. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Gallas gallas issi boori, usupun modho dorsatanne daro kuttota shukidi asaas shiishosona; qassi tammu gallasape issi toho daro baatha woyne ushsha aggoosona. Shin asaa bolla de7iya deexo toohuwa ta eriya gisho biitta shuumas bessiya katha damooze oychabike.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Ta Xoossaw, ta ha asaas oothida keehatetha ubbaa qopada taw keeha.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Nahime Bolla Medhetida Ixo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Sanbalaaxi, Xoobbey, Arabe biitta asi gidida Geesameynne hanko nu morketi nuuni gimbiya oothidi polidaysanne dooya bessi baynaysa si7idosona. Gidoshin, ta gimbe pengetas sanqa aathabike. <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanbalaaxinne Geesamey, “Ono Demban de7iya gutatape issuwan yada nuura gaheta” yaagidi kiita yeddidosona. Hessi enti tana qohanaw maqida maqo.<verse eid="NEH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Taani entaw, “Taw gita oosoy de7iya gisho hessa aggada hinte gida bessaa baanaw danda7ike. Taani yaa bin, oosoy ayis dhubetii?” yaagada zaaras. <verse eid="NEH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />He kiitaa zaari zaari oyddu toho kiittidosona; shin taani issi qommo zaaro entaw immas.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Ichashantho Sanbalaaxi ba aylletape issuwa dooya de7iya dabdaabe oythidi taako kiittis. Dabdaabey haysada yaagidi xaafetis; <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />“Neeninne ne koche gidida Ayhudeti makallanaw qopidaysanne hessa gaason gimbiya gimbeysa shooro biittan de7iya asa ubbay odeteysa Geesamey taw odis. Qassi neeni nena kawo kessanaw koyeysanne <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />neeni Yihuda kawo gideysa Yerusalaamen awaajana mela nabe wothidaysa taw odis. Ha woriya kawoy si7anaysi attenna. Hessa gisho, taara gahetada zorettanaw haaya” yaagees.<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Taani, “Ha neeni giya oda ubbay tuma gidonnabaanne ne neepe medhidaba” yaagada zaaras.<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Nu oothiya oosoy poletonna mela, “Enta kushey argaacana; oosoyka poletonna eqi attana” yaagidi nuna yashisanaw qopidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:9">Shin taani, “Xoossaw, ha77i ta kushiya minthetha” yaagada woossas.<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Taani issi gallas soope keyonna mela gordi wothida Mahexabeela na7aa na7aa Dalaya na7aa Shamayako bas. I taako, “Qamma yidi enti nena wodhanaw danda7iya gisho neera taara Xoossa keethi gelidi, pengiya gordidi qosetana” yaagis.<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Shin taani, “Ta mela asi yayyidi qosetii? Woyko tana daaniya asi ba shempuwa ashshanaw Xoossa keethi gelii? Ta hessa hanike” yaagas. <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Ta qopa be7iya wode Shamayey Xoossay kiitida nabe gidonashin Xoobeynne Sanbalaaxi iya miishen shammidi yeddin ta bolla wordo tinbite odeysa akeekas. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />I miishen shametida gaasoy tana yashisanaasa; ta hessa oothada nagaran gelana melanne tana borisiyabaa demmidi tana kawushanaassa.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Taani, “Ta Xoossaw, Xoobeynne Sanbalaaxi oothidaba ubbaa be7a. No7aado geetetiya macca nabiyanne hara wordo nabeti tana yashisanaw oothidaba ubba be7a” yaagada woossas.<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Gimbe oosoy doometin ishatammanne nam7u gallasape guye Eluule geetetiya ageenan laatamanne ichashantho gallasan oosoy poletis. <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Nu yuushuwan de7iya kawotethatan de7iya nu morketi hessa si7ida wode yayyidosonanne yeellatidosona. Ayis giiko, oosoy nu Xoossaa maaden poletidaysa akeekidosona.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />He wode Yihuda shuumati Xoobbiyas dabdaabe xaafishe gam7idosona; ika entaw zaarishe gam7is. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Era na7ay Sakani, Xoobbiya bollo gidiya gishonne iya na7ay Yohaanani Baraka na7aa Masulaama na7iw ekida gisho, Ayhudetape daroti iyara caaqidi de7oosona. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />He asati Xoobbey oothida lo77oba ubbaa ta sinthan nashidi haasayoosona; taani giyaba iyaw odoosona. Hessa gisho, Xoobbey ubba wode tana yashisanaw dabdaabe xaafo aggibeenna.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Gimbiya oosoy wurin, sanqayka gelis; pengiya naageysati, zammaretinne Leeweti banta oosuwa oykidosona. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Taani Yerusalaame katamaa aysiya maata ta ishaa Hananesinne miixa naageysata halaqaa Anaanas immas. Hanaani haratape aadhida tumanchonne Xoosse yayiya asi. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Taani entako, “Wonta away keyidi ho77ana gakanaw Yerusalaame gimbe pengeta dooyopite. Qassi omarsi naageysati banta oosuwa ongidi baanape sinthe pengeta minthi gordanaada oothite. Hessadaka, Yerusalaamen de7iya asaape dooridi baggati banta ooso bessan, harati qassi banta keethaa heeran naagana mela oothite” yaagas.<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Di7ope Simmida Asaa Sunthu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />He wode Yerusalaame katamay daro dalganne gita; shin iya giddon de7iya asaa tayboy daro guutha; qassi daro keethati buroo keexetibeenna. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Hessafe guye, asa kaaletheyisata, halaqatanne asa ubbaa shiishada enta soo asan asan mazgabana mela Xoossay tana qofisis. Di7etethaafe sinthe simmida asaa enta soo asan asan xaafetida maxaafaka demmas; he maxaafan xaafetiday haysa.<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori di7idi, ba biitta efida asape guye banta katamaa Yerusalaamenne Yihudan de7iya banta katamata simmida asay haysafe kaallidi de7eyisata. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Enta halaqati Zarubaabela, Iyyasu, Nahime, Azaara, Rama, Nahamane, Mardikiyoosa, Bilshana, Mispereta, Bigiwaya, Nahumanne Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Di7ope simmida Isra7eele asaa tayboy haysa;<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Paroosa yarati 2,172;<verse eid="NEH 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Safaaxa yarati 372;<verse eid="NEH 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Era yarati 652;<verse eid="NEH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Iyyasunne Iyo7aaba koche gidida Pahati-Moo7aba yarati 2,818;<verse eid="NEH 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Elama yarati 1,254;<verse eid="NEH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Zaatu yarati 845;<verse eid="NEH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Zakaya yarati 760;<verse eid="NEH 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Binuya yarati 648;<verse eid="NEH 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Bebaya yarati 628;<verse eid="NEH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Azgada yarati 2,322;<verse eid="NEH 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Adonqaama yarati 667;<verse eid="NEH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Bigiwaya yarati 2,067<verse eid="NEH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Adina yarati 655;<verse eid="NEH 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Hizqiyaasa yara gidida Axeera yarati 98;<verse eid="NEH 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Hashuma yarati 328;<verse eid="NEH 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Besaya yarati 324;<verse eid="NEH 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Harifa yarati 112;<verse eid="NEH 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Gaba7oona yarati 95;<verse eid="NEH 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Beetelemeninne Naxoofan de7iya asay 188;<verse eid="NEH 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Anatoota katamaa asay 128;<verse eid="NEH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Beet-Azmootan de7iya asay 42;<verse eid="NEH 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Qiriyat-Ariman, Kafiraninne Ba7erootan de7iya asay 743;<verse eid="NEH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Ramanne Gib7an de7iya asay 621;<verse eid="NEH 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Mikmaasan de7iya asay 122;<verse eid="NEH 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Beeteleninne Gayen de7iya asay 123;<verse eid="NEH 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Nam7antho Nabon de7iya asay 52;<verse eid="NEH 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />Nam7antho Elama yarati 1,254;<verse eid="NEH 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Hariman de7iya asay 320;<verse eid="NEH 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Iyaarkon de7iya asay 345;<verse eid="NEH 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Loodan, Hadidaninne Onon de7iya asay 721;<verse eid="NEH 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Sana7an de7iya asay 3,930.<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Haysafe kaallidi de7eysati di7etethaafe simmida kahineta.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:39">Iyyasu yara gidida Yadaya yarati 973;<verse eid="NEH 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Imera yarati 1,052;<verse eid="NEH 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Paskora yarati 1,247;<verse eid="NEH 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Harima yarati 1,017.<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Haysafe kaallidi de7eysati di7etethaafe simmida Leeweta;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:43">Hodawa yara gidiya Iyyasunne Qadimi7eela yarati 74;<verse eid="NEH 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Asaafa yara gidida zammaareti 148;<verse eid="NEH 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Pengiya naagiya</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:45">Saluma, Axeera, Talmoona, Aquba, Hatitanne Shobaya yarati 138.<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Haysafe kaallidi de7eysati Xoossa keethan oothiya oosanchota yarata;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 7:46">Xiha yarata, Hasufa yarata, Xaba7oota yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />Keroosa yarata, Sii7a yarata, Padoona yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />Libana yarata, Hagaba yarata, Samala yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />Hanana yarata, Gidela yarata, Gahaara yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />Raya yarata, Raxina yarata, Naqooda yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />Gazama yarata, Oza yarata, Paasa yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />Besaya yarata, Ma7unima yarata, Nafusesima yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />Baqibuuqa yarata, Haqufa yarata, Harhura yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />Baasilota yarata, Mahida yarata, Harsha yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />Barqoosa yarata, Sisaara yarata, Teema yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />Nasiya yaratanne Haxifa yarata.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Haysafe kaallidi de7eysati Solomone aylleta yarata;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 7:57">Soxaya yarata, Sofeereta yarata, Parida yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />Ya7ila yarata, Darqoona yarata, Gidela yarata, <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />Safaaxa yarata, Haxila yarata, Pokereet-Haxabayma yaratanne Amoone yarata.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Di7etethaafe simmida Xoossa keethan ootheysatinne solomone aylleta tayboy 392.<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Talmela, Telharsha, Karuba, Adaananne Imera katamatape Yerusalaame simmidosona. Shin enti woyko enta aawati Isra7eele sheeshi gideysa erisanaw danda7ibookona. <verse eid="NEH 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Enti Dalaya, Xoobbiyanne Naqooda yarata; enta tayboy 642.<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Kahinetape Hobaya yarati, Haqooxa yaratinne Barzile yarati Yerusalaame simmidosona. Barzile geysi Galada biitta asi gidida Barzile na7iw ekidi, ba bolluwa sunthaa ekis. <verse eid="NEH 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Enti banta yeletaa susa eranaw yeleta maxaafan koydosona, shin demmibookona. Hessa gisho, enti tunada taybetidi kahinetethan oothonna mela digetidosona. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Uriimeninne Tumiimen shaakidi pirdiya kahiney dendana gakanaw enti geeshsha kathaafe maanaw danda7onnaysa Yihuda haareysi entaw odis.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66-67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66-67" />Di7etethaafe Yihuda biitta simmida 7,337 addenne macca aylleta gujonna de7ishin, kumetha asaa tayboy 42,360. Qassi entara 245 addenne macca zammaareti simmidosona. <verse eid="NEH 7:66-67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Parata tayboy 736; baqulota tayboy 245; <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />gimaleta tayboy 435; hareta tayboy 6,720.<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Yarata halaqatape guuthati oosuwas imota immidosona. Biittaa haareysi 8 kilo giraame worqa, 50 distenne 530 kahine ma7ota immis. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Yarata halaqati 168 kilo giraame worqanne 1,250 kilo giraame bira immidosona. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Attida asay 168 kilo giraame worqa, 140 kilo giraame biranne 67 kahine ma7ota immidosona.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Hessafe guye kahineti, Leeweti, naageysati, zammaareti, asaape issoti issoti, Xoossa keetha oosanchotinne hara Isra7eele asay banta kataman kataman uttidosona.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Iziri Higge Maxaafa Nabbabis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Laapuntho ageenay geliya wode Isra7eele asay banta kataman kataman uttidosona. He ageenan enti ubbay issife Haatha Penge sinthan de7iya dabaaban shiiqidosona. Enti Goday Muse baggara Isra7eele asaas immida Higge Maxaafa ehana mela xaafiya Izira oychidosona. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Yaatin, kahiney Iziri, laapuntho ageenan koyro gallasan, addey, maccinne akeekanaw danda7iya asi ubbay shiiqida bessaa Higge Maxaafa ehis. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Haatha Penge sinthan de7iya dabaaban eqidi, addes, maccasinne akeekanaw danda7iya ase ubbaas Higge Maxaafa wontafe gallas gakanaw nabbabis. Asayka hayzidi si7idosona.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Xaafey Iziri, nabbabanaw mithafe oosetida dhoqa bessan keyidi eqis. Iyape ushacha baggara Matita, Shamaya, Anaya, Uraya, Kalqenne Ma7iseya geetetiya asati eqidosona. Haddirsa baggara Padaya, Misa7eela, Malkiya, Hasuma, Hashibada, Zakariyasanne Masulaama geetetiya asati eqidosona.<verse eid="NEH 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Iziri asa ubbaafe dhoqiya bessan eqiya wode ubbay iya loythidi xeellishin, enta sinthan Higge Maxaafa dooyis. I dooyiya wode enti ubbay uttida bessaafe dendi eqidosona. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Iziri Godaa, gita Xoossaa galatis. Asa ubbay banta kushiya denthidi, “Amin7i! Amin7i!” yaagidosona. Enta som7oy sa7a bochana gakanaw gufannidi Godaa goyinnidosona.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Enti banta eqida bessan de7ishin, Leeweti, Iyyasuy, Baani, Saraba, Yamina, Aquba, Sabata, Hoda, Maseya, Qalixa, Azaara, Yozabaata, Hananinne Palahi higgiya asay akeekanaada birshethaa qoncisidosona. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Enti Xoossaa Higge Maxaafa nabbabidosona; qassi nabbabeteysi woygiyako asay erana mela birshethaa qoncisidosona.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Asay higge qaala si7ida wode yeekida gisho, biitta haariya Nahimey, kahinenne xaafe gidida Izirinne asaas maxaafa birshiya Leeweti, “Ha gallasay Godaas, hinte Xoossaas geeshsha gallas gidiya gisho, yeekofite woyko afuxofite” yaagidosona.<verse eid="NEH 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Nahimey, “Bidi dooretida kathaa miite; mal7iya ushshi uyite; qassi aykoy baynaysatas hinteysafe shaakidi immite. Hachi gallasay nu Godaas geeshsha gallas. Godaa ufaysay hintew wolqa gidiya gisho azzanopite” yaagis.<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Leeweti, “Hachi gallasay geeshsha gallas gidiya gisho, azzanopite; si77i giite” yaagidi asa si77i oothidosona. <verse eid="NEH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Nabbebetida qaala birshethay entaw gelida gisho, asay ufaysan maanaw, uyanawnne aykoy baynaysatas shaakidi immanaw soo bidosona.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />He ageena nam7antho gallasan kochata halaqati, kahinetine Leeweti higge qaala entaw birshana mela Izirako yidosona. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Enti tamaariya wode laapuntha ageenan Shaqara Ba7aale bonchiya wode Isra7eele asay shaqara garsan uttidi bonchana mela Xoossay Muse baggara kiitidaysa demmidosona. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />Shaqara Ba7aale bonchanaw katamataninne Yerusalaamen haysada yaagidi awaajidosona; “Shaqara shaqaranaw dere bolla keyidi zayte shamaho, wora shamaho, barseneete mitha, zamba haythinne mitha ubbaafe higgen xaafetidaysada tashe ehite” yaagidosona.<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Hessa gisho, asay bidi mitha tashe ehidi banta pooqe keetha bolla de7iya denban, banta zabban, Xoossa keetha dabaaban, Haatha Pengiya dabaabaninne Efreema Pengiya dabaaban shaqara shaqaridosona. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Di7etethafe simmida asa ubbay shaqara shaqaridi iya garsan uttidosona. Nawe na7aa Iyyasu wodepe haa simmin enti haysa mela ba7aale bonchi erokona. Hessa gisho, enti ubbay daro ufaytidosona. <verse eid="NEH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Ba7aaley doometidi wurana gakanaw gallas gallas Iziri Xoossaa Higge Maxaafape asaas nabbabees. Baaliya laapun gallas bonchidaape guye hospuntho gallasan higgey kiiteysada geeshsha duulatta oothidosona.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Asay Banta Nagara Paaxidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />He ageenan laatamanne oyddantho gallasan Isra7eele asay issife shiiqidi, kayo ma7o ma7idi, banta huuphen baana qolidi xoomidosona. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Bantana allaga dere asaape shaakidosona. Hessefe guye dendi eqidi entinne enta aawati oothida nagaraa ubbaa paaxidosona. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Enti yan eqidi de7ishin heedzu saate kumethi Godaa enta Xoossaa Higge Maxaafay entaw nabbabetis. Qassi hara heedzu saate banta nagaraa paaxishe Godaa banta Xoossaa goyinnidosona.<verse eid="NEH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Leeweti, Iyyasuy, Baani, Qadimi7eeli, Sabana, Buni, Saraba, Bananinne, Kenaani madirake bolla keyidi banta qaala dhoqu oothidi Godaa, banta Xoossaa woossidosona. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Leeweti, Iyyasuy, Qadimi7eeli, Baani, Asabaani, Sarabi Hodi, Sabaninne Patahi, “Dendi eqidi, merinaape merinaa gakanaw de7iya Godaa hinte Xoossa galatite!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 9:5" />
  <para style="pi" vid="NEH 9:5">“Iya boncho sunthaa anjite; galatapenne anjofe aadhiya iya sunthaa sabbite.” <verse eid="NEH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Xoossaw, ne xalaali Godaa! Neeni salotanne dhoqa salotan de7iya medhetethata, sa7aanne iya bolla de7iya medhetethata, abbatanne enta giddon de7iya medhetethata ubbaa medhadasa. Ubbaas de7o immadasa; salo medhetethati new goyinnoosona.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Godaw, neeni Xoosse! Neeni Kaldaaweta biitta Uurepe Abrame doorada kessadasa. Iya sunthaa laammada Abrahaame gada sunthadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />I new ammanthiya asi gideysa be7ada, Kanaaneta, Hiteta, Amooreta, Parzeta, Yaabusetanne Gergeseta biitta iya kochaas laata biitta oothada immanaw iyaw caaqadasa. Neeni xillo gidiya gisho ne gida qaala poladasa.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />Neeni nu mayzata Gibxe biittan gakida un7aa be7adasa; qassi Zo7o Abbaa matan de7ishe enti waassida waasuwa si7adasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Gibxe kawoy, iya shuumatinne he biitta asa ubbay Isra7eele asaa bolla otortida gisho enta bolla mallatanne malaalsiyabata oothadasa. Hessa oothada hachi gakanaw ne sunthay bonchon xeegetanaada oothadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Abbaa shaakada ne asaa mela biittara pinthadasa. Shin shuchi ciimmo haathan holin, miteteysada enta goodiya morketa abban mitisada dhaysadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Isra7eele asaa gallas shaara tuussan, qamma tama tuussan enta ogiya poo7isada kaalethadasa.<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />Neeni salope wodhada ne asaa Siina zuma bolla odisadasa. Suure pirdaanne tuma gidida higgiya, lo77o wogaanne kiita entaw immadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Geeshsha ne Sambaata enti bonchana mela enta tamaarsadasa. Ne aylliya Muse baggara entaw kiita, wogaanne higge immadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Enti koshatida wode salope kathi immadasa; qassi enti saamotida wode zaallafe haathe pultisadasa. Neeni entaw immana gada caaqida biitta enti gelidi laattana mela kiittadasa.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />Shin nu mayzati otortidosona; si7onna ixidi new kiitetibookona. <verse eid="NEH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Kiitetonna ixidosona; neeni entaw oothida malaalsiyaba ubbaa hassaybookona. Enti si7onna asi gididosona; banta geellatethan aylletethas Gibxe biitta guye kaalethana mela halaqa bantaw dooridosona. Gidoshin, neeni atto giya Xoossi, keehanne maariya Xoossi; siiqon kumidaysanne hanqos ellesonna Xoossi gidiya gisho enta aggabaaka.<verse eid="NEH 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />Enti mara malan eeqa medhidi, “Hintena Gibxe biittafe kessida hinte xoossay haysa” yaagidi nena gita cashshe cayidosona. <verse eid="NEH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />Ne daro maarotethan neeni enta mela biittan aggabaaka. Enti biya ogiya poo7isana mela gallas shaara tuussan, qamma tama tuussan enta kaalethadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Enta tamaarsana mela ne lo77o Ayyaana entaw immadasa. Maanaw manna, uyanaw haathe entaw immadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Oytamu laythi kumethi mela biittan hemetiya wode entaw koshshiyabaape issibaaka pacisabaaka. Enta ma7oy wuribeenna; enta tohoy kixibeenna.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />Ne enta kawotethatanne dereta hari attoshin haahon de7iya biittata xoonidi oykana mela oothadasa. Kawoy Sihooney haariya Haseboona biittanne kawoy Oogey haariya Baasane biitta entana laatisadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Enta kochaa taybuwa salo xoolintoda darsadasa. Enta mayzatas immana gada caaqida biitta enta laatisadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Enta nayti Kanaane biitta laattidosona. He biittan de7iya Kanaane asaa enta sinthan neeni kawushadasa. Enti Kanaane asaa bolla, enta kawota bollanne biittan de7iya asaa bolla dosidaba oothana mela enta kushen aatha immadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Enti yuushoy gimbetida katamatanne aradda biitta xoonidi ekidosona. Lo77oba ubbay kumida keethata, booketida haatha ollata, woyne bessata, shamahonne hara ayfe ayfiya daro mithata laattidosona. Iyape midi kallidi ordidosona; ne gita keehatethan ufaytidosona.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />Gidoshin, enti kiitetonna ixidi, ne bolla makallidosona; ne higgiya bolla zoko zaaridosona. Neeko simmanaada entaw minthidi odida ne nabeta wodhidosona. Daro iita cashshi nena cayidosona. <verse eid="NEH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Hessa gisho, enta un7ethiya morketa kushen aatha immin, morketi enta un7ethida wode neeko waassidosona. Enta waasuwa salon gidada si7adasa; ne maarotethaa daruwan enta, enta morketa kushepe ashshiya asata kiittadasa.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />Shin enti shempo demmi simmidi zaaridi ne sinthan nagara oothidosona. Ne zaarada enta morketa kushen aathada immin, enta morketi enta haaridosona. Shin ha77ika enti neeko waassin, enta waasuwa salon gidada si7adasa. Ne maarotethan enta zaara zaaradaka ashsha ekadasa.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />Ne higgiyako enti simmana mela entaw minthada odadasa, shin enti otortidosona; new kiitetonna ixidosona. Asi kiitetidi de7o demmiya ne higgiya menthidosona. New zoko zaaridi si7onna ixidosona; kiitetonna ixidosona. <verse eid="NEH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Gidikoka ne enta daro laythi danda7adasa; ne Ayyaanan nabeta baggara entaw odadasa, shin enti si7ibookona. Hessa gisho, shooro kawotethati enta haarana mela aatha immadasa. <verse eid="NEH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Shin neeni keehanne maariya Xoossi gidiya gisho, ne gita maarotethan enta aggabaaka; burxora dhaysabaka.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />Hiza nu Xoossaw, gitaw, wolqaamanne yayetida Xoossaw, ne merinaa siiqo caaquwa naageyso, beni Asoore kawotethaafe hachi gakanaw nu bolla, nu kawota bolla, nu halaqata bolla, nu kahineta bolla, nu nabeta bolla, nu mayzata bollanne ne asa ubbaa bolla gakida metoy ne sinthan laafaba daanopo. <verse eid="NEH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Nuna gakidaba ubban neeni xillo. Nuuni nena naaqikoka ne ammanetetha aggabaaka. <verse eid="NEH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Nu kawoti, nu halaqati, nu kahinetinne nu mayzati ne higgiya naagibookona. Qassi ne entaw immida kiitaanne naagisuwa si7ibookona. <verse eid="NEH 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Ne enta kawotethan entaw gita anjuwa immadasa; dalganne aradda biitta entaw immadasa. Shin enti nena goyinnibookona; banta iita oosuwape simmibokona.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />“Hiza, hachi nuuni aylle gideysa be7a. Nu mayzati he biitte ayfiyanne iya immiya anjuwa ubbaa maana mela ne immida biittan nu hachi aylle gidida. <verse eid="NEH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Nu nagaraa gisho, ne nu bolla denthida kawoti biittay immiya ayfiya ubbaa go77etoosona. Nu bollanne nu mehiya bolla banta koydaba oothosona; nuuni gita meto giddon de7oos” yaagidosona.<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />Hanidaba ubbaa gisho, nuuni haasayidi, he haasaya xaafidi qoncisanaw qofa qachida. Xaafetida xuufiya bolla nu halaqati, nu Leewetinne nu kahineti banta maatame wothidosona.<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Maatame wothida asaa sunthay, biitta aysiya Nahimey, Hakaliya na7ay,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:1">Kahinetape, Sedeqiyaasa, <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Saraya, Azaara, Ermiyaasa, <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Paskora, Amaare, Malka, <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Haxusa, Sabana, Maluka, <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Harima, Maremoota, Obaada, <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Daanela, Ginetoona, Baaroka, <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Masulaama, Abiya, Miyamina, <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Ma7aaza, Belgayanne Shamaya.<verse eid="NEH 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Leewetape, Aznaata na7aa Iyyasu, Henadaada kochi gidida Binuya, Qadimi7eelanne <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />entara oothiya Sabana, Hodiya, Qalixa, Palaya, Hanaana, <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Mika, Rahooba, Hasabaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Zakura, Saraba, Sabana, <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hodiya, Bananne Banina.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Halaqatape, Paroosa, Pahati-Moo7aba, Elama, Zata, Baana, <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buna, Azgada, Bebaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adoona, Bigiwaya, Adina, <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Axeera, Hizqiyaasa, Azuura, <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hodiya, Hasuma, Besaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Harifa, Anatoota, Nebaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Magiphaasa, Masulaama, Ezira, <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Masezabeela, Saadoqa, Yadu7a, <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Palaxa, Hanana, Anaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hose, Hanaana, Hasuba, <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Haloheesa, Piliha, Sobeqa, <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Rehuuma, Hasabina, Maseya, <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Akiya, Hanana, Anaana, <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Maluka, Harimanne Ba7ana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Attida asay, kahineti, Leeweti, pengiya naageysati, zammaareti, Xoossa keetha oosanchoti, Xoossa higgiyas kiitetanaw bantana Ayhude gidonna deretape shaakida ubbay, enta macheti, akeekanaw danda7iya enta adde naytinne macca nayti, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />bantana kaaletheysatara issife caaqidosona. Enti Xoossa aylliya Muse baggara Xoossay immida nu Godaa, Xoossaa kiitta, higgiyanne wogaa naaganaw qangethaninne caaqon qaala gelidosona.<verse eid="NEH 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />Enti haysada yaagidi caaqidosona; “Nu macca nayta Ayhude gidonna adde naytas immoko; enta macca nayta nu adde naytas macho oothidi ekooko.<verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />“Ayhude gidonna asati kathi gidin woyko haraba Sambaata gallas woyko hara ba7aale gallas bayzanaw ehiko entafe shammoko. Laapuntha laythi gakiya wode wode nu biitta goyoko; nuuni tal7ida acuwa achoko.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />“Xoossa keetha oosuwas oyddu giraame bira laythan laythan qanxonna immana. <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Hessika, Godaa sinthan wothiya uythaas, gallas gallas yarshetiya katha yarshuwas, xuussa yarshuwas, Sambaata gallasan, ageena xeeron, laythan de7iya hara ba7aaletan, geeshsha yarshotas, Isra7eele asa nagaraa atotethas yarshetiya yarshuwasinne nu Xoossa keetha oosuwas koshshiya ubbaa kunthanaasa.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />“Nu, kahineti, Leewetinne hara asa ubbay, laythan laythan oosetiya gallasan, higgiyan xaafetidaysada Godaa, nu Xoossaa yarsho bessan eexiya mithaa issi issi kochay awude ehanaw bessiyako eranaw saama yeggida.<verse eid="NEH 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />“Katha nu shiishiya wodenne dumma dumma mitha ayfiya nu maxiya wode bayraa Xoossa keethi ehana.<verse eid="NEH 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />“Higgiyan xaafetidaysada nuuni koyro yeletiya nu adde nayta, qassi nu miizati, nu dorsatinne nu deeshati yeliya koyro marata Xoossa keethan oothiya kahinetako ehidi Xoossas dummayana.<verse eid="NEH 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />“Nuuni nu biittan kaxida kathaafe koyruwa, nu mitha ubbaa ayfiya, woyniyanne zaytiya imota oothidi, Xoossa keethan oothiya kahinetako ehana. Leeweti nu de7iya katamata goshshan ayfiyabape asraata ekiya gisho, nu biittay ayfiyabape asraata ehana. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Leeweti asraata shiishiya wode, Aarona yara gidida kahineti entara issife gidanaw bessees. Leeweti asraata shiishidaape guye, asraatape asraata kessidi nu Xoossa keethi ehidi, miishe wothiya kifiliyan wotho. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Isra7eele asaynne Leeweti kathaa, woyniyanne shamaho zayte imota geeshsha miisheti uttiya bessaanne kahineti, pengiya naageysatinne zammaareti shempiya kifiliya eho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:39">“Nuuni Xoossa keethaa ubbaka aggoko” yaagidi caaqidosona.<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaamen De7iya Asaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Asaa kaaletheysati Yerusalaamen de7idosona. Hanko asay tammaafe issoy geeshsha kataman Yerusalaamen de7ana mela saama yeggidi dooridosona. Shin hara uddufun kushe asay banta kataman kataman de7idosona. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Ba shenen Yerusalaamen de7anaw dosida asa ubbaa asay anjidosona.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Hara katamatan de7iya Isra7eele asay, kahineti, Leeweti, Xoossa keetha oosanchoti, Solomone aylleta sheeshati ubbay banta kataman kataman de7iya gadiya oykidi de7idosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:73">Nahi 7:73</ref>.</char></note> Haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysati, Yerusalaamen de7anaw yida biitta shuumata; <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Yihuda kochaafe yida asay Paaresa yara gidida Atayanne Seela yara gidida Ma7iseya. Atayi Ooziyana na7a; Ooziyani Zakaryaasa na7a; Zakaryaasi Amaare na7a; Amaarey Safaaxa na7a; Safaaxi Malal7eela na7a. <verse eid="NEH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Ma7iseyi Baaroka na7a; Baaroki Kolihooza na7a; Kolihoozi Ooza na7a; Oozi Adaya na7a; Adayi Yoyaariba na7a; Yoyaaribi Zakaryaasa na7a. Haysati Seela kochata. <verse eid="NEH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Paaresa yarape wolqaama gidida 468 asati Yerusalaamen de7idosona.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7-8" />Biniyaame kochaafe yida asay Saala, Gabayanne Salaya. Saalu Masulaama na7a; Masulaami Yo7eeda na7a; Yo7eedi Padaya na7a; Padayey Qolaya na7a; Qolayi Ma7iseya na7a; Ma7iseyi Iti7eela na7a; Iti7eeli Yeshaya na7a. Biniyaame zariyape 928 asay Yerusalaamen de7idosona. <verse eid="NEH 11:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Zikira na7ay Iyyu7eeli enta halaqa; qassi Hasanu7a na7ay Yihudi kataman nam7antho halaqa.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Kahinetape yida asay Yoyaariba na7aa Yadaya, Yakina na7aa; <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Saraya; Sarayi Kilqiya na7a; Kilqey Masulaama na7a; Masulaami Saadoqa na7a; Saadoqi Marayoota na7a; Marayooti Xoossa keetha halaqa gidida Ahixuuba na7a. <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />Entara issife Xoossa keethan oothiya oosanchoti kumethi 822. Adayi Yirohaama na7a; Yirohaami Palala na7a, Palali Amoxe na7a; Amoxey Zakaryaasa na7a; Zakaryaasi Paskora na7a; Paskora Malkiya na7a. <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />Adayara issife de7iya asaynne enta soo asaa halaqati kumethi 242. Amasasayi Azari7eela na7a; Azari7eeli Ahizaya na7a; Ahizayi Mashilmoota na7a; Mashilmooti Imera na7a. <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />Amasayara issife de7iya olanchoti kumthi 128. Hagidolima na7ay Zabdi7eeli kahineta ayseysa.<verse eid="NEH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Leewetape yida asay Shamaya; Shamayey Hashuba na7a; Hashubi Aziriqaama na7a; Aziriqaami Hasabaya na7a; Hashabey Buna na7a. <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Leeweti Sabatinne Yozabaata Xoossa keethafe karera oosetiya oosuwas halaqa. <verse eid="NEH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Mataani Mika na7a; Miki Zabida na7a; Zabidi galata woosa kaalethiya Asaafa na7a; Asaafi iya nam7antho halaqa gidida Baqibuuqa na7a; Baqibuuqi Samusa na7a; Samusi Galaala na7a; Galaali Yedutuuna na7a. <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Leewetape 284 asay geeshsha kataman Yerusalaamen de7idosona.<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Pengiya naageysatape, Aquba, Talmoonanne entara issife oothiya oosanchota tayboy 172.<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Attida kahineti, Leewetinne Isra7eele asa ubbay banta laata biittan Yihuda katamatan de7idosona. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Shin Xoossa keetha oosanchoti Yerusalaame kataman de7iya Ofeela deriya bolla de7idosona. Sihanne Gishipa geetetiya nam7u asati enta halaqata.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Yerusalaamen de7iya Leeweta halaqay Oza. Ozi Baana na7a; Baani Hasabaya na7a; Hashabey Mataana na7a; Mataani Mika na7a. Ozi Xoossa keetha zammaareta halaqa gidida Asaafa na7a. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Zammaareti gallas gallas yexana mazmuriya kawoy enta kiittees.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Yihuda na7aa Zaraha yaraape yeletida Masezabeela na7aa Pataha Isra7eele asaas doona gididi, kawa matan de7ees. <verse eid="NEH 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Yihuda asaape guuthati goshsha gadetaninne gutatan, Qiriyaat-Arbaninne iya gutatan, Diboonaninne iya gutatan, Yaqabxi7eelaninne iya gutatan de7idosona. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Qassi Iyyasun, Molaadan, Beet-Phalexan, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />Haxar-Shu7aalaninne iya gutatan, Barsaabeninne iya gutatan, <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />Xiqilaagan, Makonaaninne enta gutatan, <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />Enirmoonan, Xor7aninne Yarmutan, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />Zanohan, Adulaamaninne enta gutatan, Laakisoninne iya heeran de7iya goshsha gadiyan, Azeeqaninne iya gutatan de7idosona. Hessada hanidi Yihuda asay Barsaabepe bidi Hinooma Zangaara gakanaw de7iya bessan de7idosona.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Biniyaame kochati Gib7an, Mikmaasan, Ayan, Beeteleninne enta gutatan, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />Anatootan, Nooban, Ananiyan, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />Haxooran, Raman, Gitaman, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />Hadidan, Xabo7iman, Nabalaaxan <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Loodan, Ononinne Kushe Hiillata Zangaara geetetiya bessan de7idosona. <verse eid="NEH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Yihudan de7ida Leewetape baggati Biniyaame asaara daanada oosetidosona.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kahinetanne Leeweta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Salatiyaala na7aa Zarubaabelaranne kahine halaqaa Iyyasura di7ope simmida kahinetinne Leeweti haysata:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:1">Saraya, Ermiyaasa, Izira, <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amaare, Maluka, Haxusa, <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Sakana, Rehuuma, Maremoota, <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Ida, Ginetoona, Abiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miyamina, Ma7ada, Belga, <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Shama7a, Yoyaariba, Yadaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Saala, Amoka, Hilqiyaanne Yadaya. Haysati Iyyasu laythan kahinetasinne yaratas halaqa gididaysata.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Entara issife simmida Leeweti Iyyasu, Binuya, Qadimi7eela, Saraba, Yihudanne galata mazmure zamareyisata halaqa gidida Mataana. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Entara issife zamariya Baqbuqeynne Unoy entafe sinthara haa simmi eqidi yexoosona.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Iyyasuy Yoyaaqima yelis; Yoyaaqimi Eliyaseeba yelis; Eliyaseebi Yoyada yelis; <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoyadi Yoonataana yelis; Yoonataani Yadu7a yelis. <verse eid="NEH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Yoyaaqimi kahine halaqa gididi de7iya laythi, haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysati kahineta yarata halaqata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:12">Saraya yaraa halaqay Maraya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:12">Ermiyaasa yaraa halaqay Hananiya.<verse eid="NEH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Izira yaraa halaqay Masulaama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:13">Amaare yara halaqay Yehohanana.<verse eid="NEH 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Maluka yaraa halaqay Yoonataana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:14">Sabana yaraa halaqay Yoosefa.<verse eid="NEH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Harima yaraa halaqay Adina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:15">Marayoota yaraa halaqay Hilqaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Ido yaraa halaqay Zakaryaasa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:16">Ginetoona yaraa halaqay Masulaama.<verse eid="NEH 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Abiya yaraa halaqay Zikira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:17">Miniyaminanne Ma7ada yaraa halaqay Pilxaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Bilga yaraa halaqay Samu7a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:18">Shamaya yaraa halaqay Yoonataana.<verse eid="NEH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Yoyaariba yaraa halaqay Matanaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:19">Yadaya yaraa halaqay Oza.<verse eid="NEH 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Salaya yaraa halaqay Qalaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:20">Amoka yaraa halaqay Ebeera.<verse eid="NEH 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Kelqe yaraa halaqay Hasabaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:21">Yadaya yaraa halaqay Natina7eela.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Leeweta halaqati Eliyaseebi, Yoyada, Yohaaninne Yadu7i kahine halaqa gidida dumma dumma laythan enti xaafetidosona. He mazgabey giigiday Farse biitta kawa Daariyosa laythana. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Gidoshin, Leeweta yarata halaqati mazgaben xaafetiday Eliyaseeba na7aa na7a gidida Yohaani hayqana gakanaw de7iya wode xalaalana.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Leeweta halaqati Hasabaya, Sarabanne Qadimi7eela na7aa Iyyasu. Enti Xoossa asi gidida kawoy Dawiti kiittidaysada, nam7an shaaketi eqidi, taran taran Xoossaa bonchoosonanne galata mazmure yexoosona.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Xoossa keetha gimbe dirsaa pengiya matan keexetida dumma dumma miishe wothiya keethaa naageysati Mataana, Baqbuuqa, Abdiyu, Masulaama, Xalmoonanne Aquba. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Haysati Yoxedeqa na7aa na7aa gidada Iyyasu na7aa Yoyaaqimey, biitta aysiya Nahimeynne kahinenne xaafe gidida Iziri de7ida laythan oothidosona.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Gimbe Dirsaa Anjiso Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Yerusalaame gimbe dirsay gimbetidi wurida ba7aale bonchiya wode Leeweti banta de7iya bessaafe koyetidi, daalan, diithan, maasinqon, galata mazmure yexishe ufaysan ba7aale bonchanaw Yerusalaame yidosona. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Ha baaliya bonchanaw zammaareti Yerusalaame heeran de7iya Naxoofata gutatape, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />Beet-Gelgalape, Gib7apenne Azmaawetape shiiqidosona. Enti Yerusalaame heeran bantaw gutata keexidosona. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Kahinetinne Leeweti bantana wogada geeshidaape guye asaa, pengetanne gimbe dirsaa geeshshidosona.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Taani Yihuda halaqata gimbe dirsaa bolla kessas. Nam7u gita mazmure koyreta galata mazmure yexana mela oothas. Issi koyrey gimbiya huuphesoora ushachi simmidi, Pito Penge bagga bis. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Hoshayanne Yihuda halaqatape baggati entana kaallidosona. <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />Entara de7iya harati Azaara, Izira, Masulaama, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Yihuda, Biniyaame, Shama7iya, Ermiyaasinne <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />moyze punniya guutha kahineti kaallidosona. Entana kaallidi yiday Zakaryaasa; Zakaryaasi Yoonataana na7a; Yoonataani Shama7a na7a; Shama7i Mataana na7a; Mataani Mikaya na7a; Mikayey Zakura na7a; Zakuri Asaafa na7a. <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />Zakaryaasa yara gidida Shama7ey, Azari7eeli, Milaala, Gilaalay, Ma7ayey, Natina7eeli, Yihudinne Hanaani Xoossa asi gidida Dawiti zammariya wode go7etiya mazmure miishiya ubbaa ekidi, Zakaryaasa kaallidosona. Enta kaalethey xaafiya Izira. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Pulto Pengiya gakidaape guye Dawita Katamaako simmidi, gimbiya bolla keyidi, Dawita keethaafe pude baggara aadhidi, doloha baggara de7iya Haatha Pengiyako bidosona.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Nam7antho koyrey gimbiya huuphiya oykidi haddirsi simmidi bis. Taani asaape baggara gidada entafe guyera kaallas. Itoone Adussa Gimbiya aadhidi, Dalga Gimbiya bessaa gakida. <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />Yaape simmidi, Efreema Pengiya, Yeshaana Pengiya, Molo Pengiya, Hanaani7eela Adussa Gimbiyanne Xeetata Adussa Gimbiya gakanaw bida. Wursethan Dorsa Pengiya matara aadhidi Naageyisata Pengiya gakidi eqida.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Galata mazmure yexiya nam7u koyreti Xoossa keethan banta besse besse oykidosona. Qassi taka taara de7iya halaqatara yaa gakas. <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />Hessadaka, kahineti Eliyaqeemi, Ma7iseyi, Miniyamini, Mikayey, Eliyo7ani, Zakaryaasinne Hanaani banta moyziya oykidi, <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />Ma7iseyi, Shamayey, Alaazari, Uzi, Yehohanani, Malkiyey, Elaaminne Exeri banta bessaa bessaa oykidosona. Yizira enta kaalethin banta qaala dhoqu oothidi mazmure yexidosona.<verse eid="NEH 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />He gallas daro yarsho yarshidosona. Xoossay entaw gita ufaysi immida gisho daro ufaytidosona. Maccasay nayti ubbay ufaytidosona. Yerusalaamen asay ufaytiya ufaysa kooshinchay haahon si7etees.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />He gallas asay immiya imotata, asraatanne laythan kaxiya katha ayfiyape koyruwa shiishidi wothiya keetha naagiya halaqata dooridosona. Ha dooretida asati dumma dumma katamatan de7iya goshshatape higgey kiitteysada kahinetasinne Leewetas bessiya kathaa shiishosona. Ayis giiko, Yihuda asay kahinetinne Leeweti oothiya oosuwan daro ufaytidosona. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Enti Xoossay kiitidaysa oothidosona; geeshsho wogaa polidosona. Enta xalaala gidonashin zammaretinne naageysati Dawitinne iya na7aa Solomoney kiitida oosuwa polidosona. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Beni Dawita wodenne Asaafa wode zammaretinne Xoossas shiiqiya galata mazmureta kaalethiya halaqati de7oosona. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Zarubaabela laythaninne Nahime laythan Isra7eele asa ubbay zammaretasinne naageysatas bessiya kathaa gallas gallas immoosona. Leewetaska bessiya kathaa immoosona. Leeweti qassi Aarona yara gidida kahinetas bessiya kathaa immoosona.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nahimey Ehida Laame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />He gallas asa ubbay si7ishin, Muse Maxaafay nabbabetis; he wode enti, “Moo7abe asaynne Amoone asay Xoossaa asaara merinaw gahetanaw bessenna” giya bessaa maxaafan demmidosona. <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />Ayis giiko, Isra7eele asay Gibxefe keyidi, Kanaane biya wode Moo7abenne Amoone biitta asay entaw kathinne haathe immidi mokanaysa aggidi, Isra7eele asaa baaddana mela Balaamas miishe immidi shammidosona. Gidoshin, nu Xoossay baadetha anjon laammis. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />He higgiya Isra7eele asay si7ida wode allaga asaa banta giddofe shaakidosona.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Hessafe kase Xoossa keetha miisheta wothiya keethaas halaqa gidida kahiney, Eliyaseebi Xoobara dabbotethi medhis. <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />Hessafe gaason Eliyaseebi, katha imotata, ixaane, Xoossa keetha geeshsha miisheta, kathaa woyniyanne zaytiya, Leewetas, zammaretasinne naageysatas immiya asraatanne kahinetas immiya kathaa wothiya wogga kifiliyan Xoobbey daana mela immis.<verse eid="NEH 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Ha ubbay haniya wode ta Yerusalaamen de7ike. Arxekisisey Babiloone biittan kawotida hastamanne nam7antho laythan taani simmada Babiloone biitta kawako bas. Gidoshin, guutha wodepe guye kawa oychada, <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Yerusalaame simmada yas. Xoossa keetha zabban Eliyaseebi Xoobbiyas daana kifile giigisidi wothida iitabaa si7as. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Daro yilotada, Xoobbiya soo miishe ubbaa kifiliyape kessada kare holas. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Kifilya wogaada geeshshana mela kiittas. Xoossa keetha miisheta, kathaa, imotatanne ixaaniya zaarada keethaa gelsas.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Qassi asay Leewetas bessiya kathaa immiboona gisho Leewetinne zammaareti banta Xoossa keetha oosuwa aggidi goshshas guye bidaysa be7as. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Hessa gisho, taani halaqatako, “Xoossa keetha oosuwa ayis yeggi aggidetii?” yaagada hanqetas. Hessafe guye, Leeweta xeegada ubbaa enta oosuwan oosuwan zaaras. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Yaatin Yihuda asay kathaafe, woyniyape, zaytiyape immiya asraata wothiya keethaa zaaridi eho doomis. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Taani kahiniya Salama, xaafiya Saadoqanne Leewiya Padaya miishe wothiya keethaas halaqa oothada shuumas. Qassi Mataana na7aa na7aa Zakura na7ay Hanaani enta maaddeysa. Haysati ubbay koshshiyaba ubbaa banta ishatas shaaki shaaki imon ammanetidaysata gididosona.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />“Ta Xoossaw tana qopa; qassi ne keetha oosoy giigana mela taani oothida lo77o oosuwa dogopa” yaagas.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />He wode taani Yihudan de7iya asay Sambaata gallas woyne gum7ishin be7as; harati kathi, woyne ushsha, woyne ayfiya, balase ayfiyanne harabata banta haren caanidi, Sambaata gallas Yerusalaame ehishin be7as. Hessa gisho, enti Sambaata gallasa zal7onaada taani entaw minthada odas. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Hessa bolla qassi Yerusalaamen de7iya Xiroosa asay molonne hara issi issi zal7e miisheta ehidi Sambaata gallas Yihuda asaasinne Yerusalaamen bayzoosona. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Taani Yihuda halaqata, “Haysa mela iita ooso oothidi Sambaata ayis tuniseetii? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Xoossay nu bollanne nu katamaa bolla haysa mela meto ehiday, kase hinte aawati hessa mela iitabaa oothida gisho gidennee? Ha77i hinte Sambaata tunisidi, Isra7eele asaa bolla hara hanqo ehanaw haneeta” yaagada hanqetas.<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Hessafe guye, Sambaati gelanaape sinthe Yerusalaame gimbiya pengeti gordetanaadanne Sambaati aadhonashin dooyetonna mela kiittas. Qassi Sambaata gallasan ayba toohoyka gelonnaada naagana mela ta oosanchotape issota issota gimbe pengiya bolla essas. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Hessa gisho, dumma dumma zal7e miisheta ehiya zal7anchoti issi toho woyko nam7u toho Yerusalaame gimbiyafe kare baggara aqidosona. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Shin taani entako, “Gimbiyafe karera waananaw aqeetii? Hinte nam7antho haysada oothiko taani wolqan hintena teqana” yaagada hanqetas. He gallasape simmin nam7antho Sambaata gallas yibookona. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Taani Leeweti banta huuphiya geeshshana mela, pengeta naagana melanne Sambaata gallasaa geeshshi oothana mela kiittas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">“Ta Xoossaw, ha ubbaa gisho tana qopa; ne merinaa siiquwa gisho taw qadheta” yaagada woossas.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />He wode taani Yihuda adde asape issoti issoti Ashdooda, Amoonenne Moo7abe biittafe macho ekidaysa be7as. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Enta naytape baggay Ashdooda biitta woyko hara biitta doona haasayoosona; banta biitta, Yihuda doona odetanaw danda7okona. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Taani entara ooyetas; enta baaddas; entafe issota issota dechada, enta huuphiya binaana shoddas. Hessa xalaala gidonashin, enti banta macca nayta enta adde naytas immonnaada, enta macca nayta bantawunne banta adde naytas ekonnaada Xoossaa sunthan caaqisas. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Qassi entako, “Kawoy Solomoney nagara oothiday allaga biitta maccasata ekoysana gidennee? Solomone mela kawoy hara biitta kawota giddon baawa; Xoossay iya dosida gisho, Isra7eele asa ubbaa bolla kawoyis. Shin, hara attoshin iyaka allaga biitta maccasati haysa mela nagara oosisidosona. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Yaatin, nuka hintena si7idi, allaga maccasa ekidi hessa mela iitabaa oothidi Xoossaa naaqaneyee?” yaagas.<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Kahine halaqaa Eliyaseeba naytape issoy Yoyada. Shin iya naytape issoy Beet-Horona katama asi gidida Sanbalaaxa na7iw macho ekis. Yaatin, taani Yoyada Yerusalaame katamaape gooddas.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />“Ta Xoossaw, haysati kahinetetha wogaanne kahinetaranne Leewetara caaqida caaquwa waati tunisidaako be7a” yaagada woossas.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Enta allaga biitta tunatethaafe geeshidaape guye kahinetasinne Leewetas enta oosuwa oosuwa immas. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Yarshos eethiya mithay woden woden yaana melanne asay baw ayfidabape koyro ayfiya imota oothidi ehana mela wogaa wothas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">“Ta Xoossaw, ne keehatethan tana qopa” yaagada woossas.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>